# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# DocuMind AI — Backend Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# Generate a secure SECRET_KEY with:
#   python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(64))"

# ── Environment Mode ─────────────────
# Values: development, production, testing
ENVIRONMENT=development

# ── Database (Required) ──────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/documind_ai

# ── Security (Required) ─────────────
# Must be at least 32 characters. Use a cryptographically random value.
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here-must-be-at-least-32-characters
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# ── AI / LLM ─────────────────────────
# OpenAI (optional — Ollama is the primary LLM provider)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Ollama (default LLM provider)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:8b

# ── Upload ────────────────────────────
# UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
# MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=50

# ── CORS ──────────────────────────────
# Override default origins (comma-separated JSON array)
# CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000","http://127.0.0.1:3000"]

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
